sequenceDiagram
    actor Human
    actor Agent
    participant API as agent-tasks API
    participant Inbox as Signal inbox
    participant Audit as Audit log

    Note over Human,Audit: 1. Human creates a task
    Human->>API: POST /api/projects/{id}/tasks
    opt task is open and the team has claim-eligible agents
        API->>Inbox: task_available to each agent
        API->>Audit: task.created (event task_available_signal)
    end

    Note over Agent,Audit: 2. Agent picks up work
    Agent->>API: task_pickup
    API-->>Agent: { kind: signal | review | work | idle }

    Note over Agent,Audit: 3. Agent claims the task
    Agent->>API: task_start { taskId }
    API->>API: dependency gate, confidence gate
    alt unresolved blocker
        API-->>Agent: 409 blocked
    else enforcementMode BLOCK and below threshold or keystone violated
        API-->>Agent: 422 low_confidence
    else gates pass
        API->>Audit: task.claimed
        API-->>Agent: { kind: work, task, expectedFinishState, effectiveGates }
    end
